en  it's updated how do you feel about an  official metro never coming to night  city let me know in the comments  a new patch for dying light 2 has gone  live on pc and between a few tweaks to  the zombie apocalypse sandbox one of the  game's more annoying bugs has been fixed  as pc players discovered loading a fresh  save of 9 light 2 occasionally locked  them into a death loop  not that one where they'd constantly die  over and over dying during a quest  within a restricted area would result in  them being respawned in a different area  and facing a time limit that would not  allow them to get back to the previous  mission area on time that issue has been  fixed alongside a few others a  playstation and xbox version of this  patch will also be going live soon  according to teclan  in other dying light 2 news the game's  first free dlc is now available if you  sided with the game's militaristic  peacekeepers you can grab the authority  pack that includes some neat clothing  and armor on february 18th the  two-handed authority hammer will be made  available  if you've already snagged the dying  light 2 dlc what do you think of it so  far let me know in the comments and of  course leave a like subscribe and come  back tomorrow for another episode of  gamespot news see you later  [Music]  you
 

